She laughed merrily at his playful warning.\par
The wind was very cold, but the sunshine was clear and warm. She rode speedily through the golden-hued light of the late afternoon. What a nice day, she thought. However, as soon as she reached Arvis, she could tell that something was off.\par
Suddenly, a firefighting carriage sped past her towards the mansion. \ldblquote Layla! Layla!\rdblquote  Chef Mona shouted as she frantically ran up to her, grasping her hands when she reached her.\par
