\ldblquote What? What did Uncle Bill do?\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote They said that the generator exploded because of something that Bill did, but I didn\rquote t catch any more details than that. Dowager Herhardt got injured when the greenhouse started to cave in, so the whole mansion is in an uproar. It looks like they\rquote ve got the fire under control, and right now, the police are talking to-\rdblquote\par
\ldblquote Uncle Bill!\rdblquote  Layla shouted, seeing Bill being led by two police officers to their car. She started running towards them at once.\par
Bill\rquote s face looked blank until he heard Layla\rquote s voice, at which point he looked at her with a helpless expression.\par
