Eventually she managed to put the thoughts out of her mind, but they had continued to flash back into her consciousness throughout the day. She was experiencing an immense amount of pain and shame. And the fact that she wasn\rquote t able to do what she wanted made her feel even more despair.\par
Without considering any of that, it was clear to her that the things the duke did to her were not acts of love. However, they weren\rquote t the acts of a brute, either. He wasn\rquote t simply following an instinctual drive.\par
