explanation was so simple. \ldblquote Layla!\rdblquote\par
\par
The sound of Uncle Bill calling her name had finally motivated her to get up. She had closed the window, drawn the curtains, and wiped the tears from her eyes before going to him.\par
She had also made a resolution for herself. From then on, she was never going to beg or cry in front of the duke. She hoped that if she denied him those pleasures, he would grow tired of her faster and discard her.\par
After thinking back on all that as she stood by the bed in the cabin, she proceeded to remove her blouse, skirt, and shoes. Removing her undergarments took more courage, but after a moment she started to do so. Considering everything the duke had already done with her body, it was silly to hide it from him now. More than anything, she didn\rquote t want to feel like she was being forced. If she had to be here in the duke\rquote s bedroom, she was going to pretend to herself that it was her own choice.\par
Matthias let out a sigh as he gazed at her standing topless across the room.\par
She stood for a moment with her arms folded, blocking her breasts from view, then lowered her arms and removed the rest of her undergarments, piece by piece. Finally, she removed her stockings, and stood before him without a thread of clothing on her.\par
He wondered if she had gone mad. There was no other explanation for her sudden shift in attitude.\par
She gathered her clothes from the floor and placed them on a chair next to the bed, then pulled out the pin holding up her hair and let her smooth, blonde locks tumble down to her shoulders.\par
Matthias\rquote s eyes remained still, but his breath had started to quicken slightly. Realizing that he had been gripping his arm quite tightly, he let go and swept his hair back from his forehead. As he did this, she sat down at the foot\par
\par
of the bed. Despite the boldness with which she had just undressed, her whole body was now trembling.\par
He slowly walked up to her. Unsure where to look, she lowered her eyes and stared at her feet.\par
\ldblquote What are you doing?\rdblquote  he asked as he grabbed her chin.\par
She looked straight into his eyes right away. \ldblquote I\rquote m doing my part,\rdblquote  she replied. While her tone was harsh, the shakiness in her voice made her sound harmless.\par
\ldblquote And what\rquote s your part?\rdblquote  he asked, narrowing his eyes in amusement.\par
A frightened look appeared in her eyes, but she confidently replied, \ldblquote You already know.\rdblquote  Her shoulders twitched, but she maintained eye contact. \ldblquote You decided on my role when you set the deal.\rdblquote\par
His gaze moved down from her face to her chest, which was quickly rising and falling with her breath, and then moved to her hands, which were clasped together on her lap.\par
It\rquote s like she\rquote s an elegant noblewoman, only naked, he thought, lifting his gaze to her face again. When he saw her large eyes, a dry laugh escaped his lips. I wonder if paying a lady of the night to sleep with me would make me feel as dirty as I do right now. Soon his laughter faded, and only coldness remained in his eyes.\par
He patted her on the head, as if telling her she was doing a good job. His touch felt soft and relaxed. His grin gave the same impression.\par
Just as she was starting to get an ominous feeling, he grabbed her throat tightly, almost choking her. As her face started to go pale, he pushed her back onto the bed and got on top of her.\par
As he was doing so, he chuckled. The mirror hanging above the marble mantelpiece was showing his reflection. Instead of seeing the old Matthias von Herhardt, the perfect gentleman who had lived a serene, orderly life, he now\par
\par
saw a man in the clutches of passion, his face twisted in the desperate pursuit for the object of his desire.\par
As Layla\rquote s heavy breathing quieted down, Matthias got out of the bed. This fact barely registered with her as she lay face down, exhausted.\par
Good, she thought. It\rquote s over. Good. To avoid provoking his desire again, she remained still as a corpse for several minutes, clutching the wrinkled sheet, hoping that he would leave soon.\par
When she heard his footsteps grow faint, she breathed a sigh of relief. She felt like her body would fall apart if she had to do anything more with him.\par
However, she soon realized that her relief was premature. His faint footsteps started to grow louder again. Her knuckles were white as she clutched the sheet. She wasn\rquote t sure if he had reentered the bedroom. She could have found out by simply looking up, but she hated the thought of making eye contact with him again.\par
While she lay there, helplessly praying that he would leave, the now fully dressed duke sat down on the bed next to her. Chuckling, he playfully ran his fingers through her hair a few times, then whispered, \ldblquote Good job, Layla.\rdblquote\par
