So, Layla, will you be my happiness?\par
Of course, I can\rquote t promise you a life of luxury, at least not right now. Without my parents\rquote  support, I don\rquote t have much yet. But what I can promise you, is that I will cherish you. You will be the whole world to me. And I won\rquote t let you get hurt, Layla.\par
