Layla read the letter over and over again, until dawn broke. Whenever she entertained the thought that a future with Kyle could be a reality, she was soon reminded of the nightmarish life that the duke was forcing her to live.\par
\par
When she heard the sound of Bill stirring in his room, she got out of bed as well. Walking over to the heater in the corner of her room, she placed the precious letter into it. In a matter of seconds, it turned to ash and disappeared.\par
