Layla bore a cold expression on her face as she looked out the window of the stopped car. She wasn\rquote t surprised that they had arrived in front of a hotel, but she didn\rquote t want to get out.\par
\ldblquote Uh\'85 Layla?\rdblquote  The chauffeur said, looking worriedly at his watch.\par
When Mark Evers had delivered the duke\rquote s order to him, he had emphasized that he needed to bring Layla as quickly as possible. He had\par
\par
complied with this order by driving faster than usual back to Karlsbar.\par
