For each bird he pointed to. she immediately supplied the name. Her gentle pronunciation made the bird names sound like music to his ears. He longed to hear her say his own name in that same tone. He could feel himself growing warmer.\par
\ldblquote You have all those memorized?\rdblquote  he asked. \ldblquote I live right next to the forest,\rdblquote  she replied. \ldblquote What\rquote s your favorite type of bird?\rdblquote\par
