\ldblquote That one is a pigeon,\rdblquote  she quickly blurted out, wanting to break the awkward silence.\par
Before she realized how silly it was for her to tell him this, he chuckled and replied, \ldblquote I know\rdblquote  Raising his eyebrows briefly, he glanced at the bird and then back at her.\par
\ldblquote Ah, yes\'85\rdblquote  Of course he knows what pigeons look like, she thought, picking up her spoon again. \ldblquote I see,\rdblquote  she muttered.\par
